@Tacticalstump $RUM is up 60% in 10 days.  I am sure there are a ton of &quot;Lock in profit&quot; folks who are counting on this to settle down, maybe sink back into the 8s over a couple of weeks and be able to climb back in, rinse and repeat.   

Possibly - but I think still a solid day when $AVGO $NVDA $AMD and a lot of other AI / heavy hitting tech stocks were down.     

Had this been a generally green day, not the trade issues with Canada, etc, this would have popped and stayed above 10.

$MU $SNDK $SNXX $SPY Micron is tanking today as Samsung&#39;s disappointment drags the entire memory and chip sector lower. 

Jim Cramer visited Micron last week wearing a Micron hard hat and posted &quot;Time to prep!!&quot; 

MU has lost ~$56,003,000,000 in market cap today!

